WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.970
Rejoice. I hope you got an
opportunity in this fuel session

2
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.310
today to do a little rejoicing.

3
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:13.830
And let me just encourage
you with this: that sometimes

4
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.690
the greatest things that are
ever gonna result from your life

5
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.410
may be things you're
never even gonna see.

6
00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.610
Let's think about
that for a second.

7
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.370
Let's think about fruit, right?

8
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.810
That something is bearing fruit.

9
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.250
We might call that
evidence, right?

10
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.390
I think about that
as like fitness.

11
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.630
Right? Something's happening.

12
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.310
And yet it may be the result of
something that you're doing in

13
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.510
your life right now.

14
00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.150
But you're not even gonna see it.

15
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.390
And I think about that
with faithfulness.

16
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.340
Think about the fruit of
your faithfulness to God.

17
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.520
What if your faith today

18
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.890
is building itself
for a generation yet

19
00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:58.090
to come? Would that
change your perspective?

20
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.490
Even if you were in the middle
of something really challenging

21
00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.810
today, something
really difficult today?

22
00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:06.250
Maybe you're thinking about just,
man, I'm just gonna walk away

23
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:07.290
from this thing altogether.

24
00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.410
And you came here and you're
doing this DAILY FUEL session.

25
00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.450
You've imagined like Mary and the
joy that she's gonna have with

26
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.570
Jesus, and Jesus is gonna change
lives for generations to come.

27
00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.330
And she's internalizing all
that instead of having fear.

28
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.880
Right, she has joy.

29
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.760
And the Lord's just saying to you,

30
00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:32.260
come home to me because the
fruit of your faithfulness

31
00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:35.620
is good fruit. Lord, we love you.

32
00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.740
We thank you for this day.

33
00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:37.700
We thank you for this time.

34
00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:41.600
Lord, we thank you for the
legacy of faithfulness.

35
00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:45.380
God, that these
fruits aren't ours.

36
00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:48.820
They're not even
ours to harvest, God.

37
00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.780
They're fruits that are yours.

38
00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:56.340
God, they're for your glory
and for your goodness.

39
00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.510
And so, Lord, may we just be
encouraged today that the fruit of

40
00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.350
our faithfulness may be for
a generation yet to come.

41
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.440
In Jesus' name, amen.

